        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here\u2019s a **Facebook post designed to drive people to the GoFundMe**. The key with Facebook fundraising is: emotional hook \u2192 story \u2192 clear ask \u2192 share request. I also included **photo ideas that statistically perform well for animal rescue fundraising.**\n\n---\n\n# Facebook Post (High-Engagement Version)\n\nThere is a crisis happening for community cats here on the **Big Island of Hawaii**\u2026 and most people have no idea.\n\nEvery day cats are being **abandoned, starving, and left to fend for themselves**.\n\nDumping animals is illegal, yet it continues to spiral out of control. These cats didn't choose this life. They were someone\u2019s responsibility once, and now they are fighting to survive.\n\nTo make matters worse, **Bill 51 was passed by the county**, making it illegal to feed animals on county property. People trying to help these cats can now face **fines or even jail time**.\n\nMeanwhile, some vigilantes have begun taking matters into their own hands. Many of us who volunteer to help community cats are now **afraid for our safety while simply trying to protect innocent animals.**\n\nSo my husband and I decided to follow our hearts.\n\nWe are building a **cat rescue sanctuary on the Big Island** where abandoned and feral cats can finally have:\n\n\u2022 Food and clean water  \n\u2022 Veterinary care  \n\u2022 Warm beds and blankets  \n\u2022 A safe place to live  \n\u2022 The opportunity to be adopted into loving homes\n\nBut creating this sanctuary requires supplies we simply cannot do alone.\n\nWe are raising funds for:\n\n\u2022 Medical care and vaccinations  \n\u2022 Humane traps and rescue equipment  \n\u2022 Microchip scanners  \n\u2022 Food and daily care supplies  \n\u2022 Beds, blankets, and shelters  \n\u2022 Building materials for safe enclosures\n\nWe have launched a **GoFundMe to help us raise $5,000** to complete the sanctuary so we can start saving these cats immediately.\n\nIf you love animals and want to help make a difference, please consider donating or sharing.\n\nEven $5 helps feed a cat.\n\nAnd sharing this post could help save a life.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f GoFundMe link in comments \u2764\ufe0f\n\nThank you for caring about these innocent animals.\n\n---\n\n# Photos That Will Increase Donations\n\n## 1. Stray / Community Cats That Need Help\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"Hawaii stray cat colony outdoor feeding area\",\"feral cats living outdoors tropical environment\",\"abandoned cats colony near beach Hawaii\",\"skinny stray cat looking at camera rescue\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nThese images help people **feel the urgency** of the problem.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Cats Being Rescued / Helped\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"animal rescue volunteer holding rescued kitten\",\"feral cat rescue trap humane trap cat rescue\",\"volunteer feeding rescued cats shelter\",\"rescued cat being examined by veterinarian\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nThese show **hope and action**, which increases donations.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Vision of the Sanctuary\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"outdoor cat sanctuary enclosure safe cat habitat\",\"cat rescue sanctuary outdoor fenced area\",\"cat shelter sanctuary with multiple cats safe enclosure\",\"community cat sanctuary environment cats relaxing\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nPeople donate more when they **see the end goal**.\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 **Pro tip for your sister's GoFundMe:**  \nThe **first photo should be a close-up of a cat\u2019s face**. Emotional eye contact dramatically increases donations.\n\n---\n\nIf you'd like, I can also help you create:\n\n\u2022 **A viral \u201cbefore/after rescue\u201d post that spreads locally in Hawaii**  \n\u2022 **A second post designed for animal rescue groups to share**  \n\u2022 **A simple sanctuary name and logo for the fundraiser**  \n\u2022 **A strategy that could raise $10K+ instead of $5K**\n\nAnimal rescues can actually go viral very easily if structured right. \ud83d\udc3e"
          ]
