        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Can you create a GoFundMe me for my sister who live on the big island in Hawaii. Can we set the amt for  $3000-$5000? Or higher? Lower?  Key points to make: -husband and I are following our hearts and building a cat rescue sanctuary on Big Island Hawaii -Cats are in danger of death and starvation every day  -Bill 51 creates by the county on Big Island states that no animals are to be fed on county property and all feeders to be fined and eventually jailed  -Dumping by residents is illegal yet continues to spiral out of control -Vigilantes are taking the law into their own hands. Myself and the 1000\u2019s of other community cat volunteers are in fear for our safety every day -Our govt encourages the death and starvation of these innocent community cats, caused by dumping.  -Our sanctuary will be for adopting feral/community cats and giving them a safe place to be loved and cared for -Medical care, building costs, food, beds, blankets, trap, microchip scanners and supplies are astronomical and we need the help to complete the build ASAP in order to support these kitties and keep them safe.  "
          ]
